one calls and yet Pamela your  former employer says that the children  they're fed nutritious food provided  essentials such as clothing and  toiletries and are visited by doctors as  well so what did you see that bothered  you what bothered me was that for  example a lot of these kids through the  medical department they were taking very  very long time to get seen  [Music]  also the psychological trauma that was  going on a lot of the kids weren't being  seen right away you know Michael when we  spoke on Wednesday you told me that in  one of the videos that we saw of a  little boy named Leo his mother Lourdes  had been deported back to Guatemala  Pamela do the kids understand that their  parents in some cases may be thousands  of miles away from where they are a lot  of them they don't even understand  because if you see in the in the video  of Jessica a dynamic stir first about  where her mother is she said in the  States so she thought her mom was still  in the in in the States but she has no  idea she it took her a while to figure  out yes it's in Virginia but a lot of  these kids they have no idea where their  parents are in over 80% of the cases  that I'm involved in and I represent  over 60 mothers you know for 80% of  those cases the parents don't know where  the children are and the children don't  know where the parents are the  government has effectively stolen these  children from these parents and have  refused to tell the parents where  they're at because in most cases they  don't know where they're at I mean this  is a travesty  that these parents have been separated  from their children and vice versa and  there does not appear to be a will to  reunite these children with their  parents we keep hearing though Michael  that the reunification process is  underway that the that the kids are  being allowed to communicate with their  parents and vice versa  that's not your experience that's just  not true Gail I have countless parents  that I'm representing mothers that don't  know where their children are want to  communicate with their children are not  able to communicate with their children  and I see nothing to indicate that  there's any concentrated effort to  reunite these kids with their parents  how complicated is this it's not that  complicated if there's a will to reunite  these kids well that what you're saying  too familiar that there's no really is  there a system to figure out how to get  the children and their parents back  together that you could see well the  system that I know about is that they  have this system where it's called like  a sponsor where they find a sponsor for  the child but at the end of the day  that's not who you came with to the  United States you didn't come with you  came with your family so that's how you  that's who you  should be with not a regular sponsor  that they probably don't even know and I  don't think that we should be handing in  our kids to any stranger you know I  think that is important for these kids  to stay here one of the things we keep  hearing though Michael is that you know  drug dealers and gang members or in some  cases using these children to get into  the country or that they are slipping  through the country themselves by with  these kids what is your experience with  that Gail there may be an isolated  incident here or there but that's a  bunch of nonsense and it's designed by  the President and some of his supporters  to create this boogeyman in a closet and  scare people these mothers and fathers  have come to the United States in an  effort to to pursue the American dream  and to pursue a better life for  themselves and their children these are  thugs or not drug dealers they're not  using kids as shields it's an absolute  absurdity yeah were you saying that gang  members and drug dealers coming in no  not at all is the opposite people are  running away from the gangs they're not  there there's no gangs coming in and if  you see the rates they're actually lower  you knew you could lose your job by  doing this yeah but you knew you could  lose your job yes I knew that but I  think that it's very important for this  to come out because I noticed that  nobody was doing anything and I thought  that by me actually coming out and  showing my face will give the courage to  other people to actually do the same  because I think that right now is not or  never this is the time to reunite these  families and this is what needs to  happen right now in Michael avenatti we  know you would store me down he was  lawyer now it's like now Michael  avenatti is involved in this case well  Gail I'd say about that I've been  fighting against injustice for 18 years  and I'm gonna continue to do so and it  just so happens that this president is  constantly on the other side of the law  and outside the bounds of the law and if  I see something that bothers me that I  think people need support and assistance  I'm gonna provide it how do you reach  out to him he reach out to you know I  reached out to him I did my own personal  research within the company also about  avenatti and I was that gave to me the  trust that I could trust on him so you  would who did did he ask you to tape  no no everything happened afterwards me  doing my research and looking for  somebody that I could trust all right  Miller we thank you Mike  thank you for coming today okay both and  very brave of you to do that  I hadn't seen what was happening in  those facilities thank very courageous  we don't get to see you inside the  facilities I hope more people show up  thank you right

